WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:08.664
Hi! This is the last unit of A1. Great!

2
00:00:09.064 --> 00:00:13.152
Today: writing and speaking for the exam.

3
00:00:14.867 --> 00:00:17.827
Writing has two parts:

4
00:00:18.227 --> 00:00:24.835
Part one: you fill in a form. Only words and numbers!

5
00:00:25.235 --> 00:00:31.243
Part two: you write a message of about thirty words.

6
00:00:32.933 --> 00:00:35.677
For friends you write:

7
00:00:36.077 --> 00:00:41.197
Dear Anna. At the end: Best wishes.

8
00:00:41.597 --> 00:00:44.053
Formally you write:

9
00:00:44.453 --> 00:00:50.653
Dear Ms Weber. At the end: Yours sincerely.

10
00:00:51.053 --> 00:00:54.901
And write something about all three points!

11
00:00:56.600 --> 00:01:02.272
Speaking has three parts. You speak in a group:

12
00:01:02.672 --> 00:01:06.256
Part one: you introduce yourself.

13
00:01:06.656 --> 00:01:11.272
Part two: you ask questions with a word card.

14
00:01:11.672 --> 00:01:16.576
Part three: you make a request with a picture card.

15
00:01:18.267 --> 00:01:23.075
Listen: Kofi and Lena are in the exam.

16
00:01:23.475 --> 00:01:29.339
My card: weekend.

17
00:01:29.739 --> 00:01:32.819
What do you do at the weekend?

18
00:01:33.219 --> 00:01:35.987
I often go swimming.

19
00:01:36.387 --> 00:01:39.275
Please give me the pen!

20
00:01:39.675 --> 00:01:42.155
Here you are.

21
00:01:42.555 --> 00:01:44.795
Thank you!

22
00:01:46.500 --> 00:01:57.092
Now you! Introduce yourself as in the exam: name, age, country, home, languages, job and hobby.

23
00:02:12.800 --> 00:02:16.936
Great! Now you can:

24
00:02:17.336 --> 00:02:25.912
Congratulations! You've completed A1. Now you're ready for the exam.

25
00:02:26.312 --> 00:02:29.560
Good luck – you can do it!
